[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-glasgow-sanctuary-scholarships-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-98":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},98,"university-of-glasgow-sanctuary-scholarships-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-98","University Of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships 2026 In Uk | Fully Funded","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested students for the 2026 University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Get Realtime Updates from.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University Glasgow\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition Waver\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends  £5,000 per year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 29th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full tuition fee waiver for the duration of study, where you are not eligible to apply for mainstream student finance to cover \u003Cstrong>full\u003C\u002Fstrong> tuition fees \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>£5,000 per year towards for study costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the University of Glasgow Sanctuary Scholarships, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a \u003Cstrong>conditional or unconditional offer\u003C\u002Fstrong> for full-time study at the University of Glasgow for 2026\u002F27\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be \u003Cstrong>located in the UK\u003C\u002Fstrong> with Home or RUK fee status\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Meet one of the following criteria regarding immigration status:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submitted an asylum claim in the UK\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Actively appealing a negative asylum decision\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Granted Refugee Status, Humanitarian Protection, or Discretionary Leave\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Alternatively, come to the UK through resettlement schemes such as:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>UK Resettlement Scheme (UKRS)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Afghan Citizens Resettlement Scheme or Afghan Relocations and Assistance Policy (ARAP)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Syrian Vulnerable Persons Resettlement Scheme (VPRS)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ukraine Sponsorship or Family Schemes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-25 10:06:18",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-glasgow-sanctuary-scholarships-2026-in-uk-fully-funded\u002F69c3a58a5d9e39.19013083_screenshot 2026-03-25 095719.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-glasgow-sanctuary-scholarships-2026-in-uk-fully-funded\u002F69c3a58a5d9e39.19013083_screenshot%202026-03-25%20095719.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",1,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18